    - rid: 3046478981849153621
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: Humph... So you have more questions. Go ahead.
        condition:
          dialogueText: "Yes, I know, she sent you in to lie about how \"good\" my
            cooking was so that I would \"feel better\", smile a bit more and not
            scare the guests away when they see me.\nEvery time, she sends some poor
            guest to do that, and every time, they go back sadder than they were
            when they arrived... and yet she never gets the message. \nA word of
            advice, son: it's best if you don't even waste your time trying."
