      data:
        altDialogue: So you've told me, yes. What was your question?
        condition:
          dialogueText: '...And you lied to her so that you could come in and talk
            to me.

            Humph... That''s dangerous, but admirable. Definitely
            more interesting than the alternative.

            Ask then, please.
            It''s not like I''m ever busy in this desolated hotel.'
